# NOTE: scenarios/ is intentionally NOT ignored here.
# It should be pushed from the cluster but not from personal machines.
# On personal machines, add "scenarios/" to .git/info/exclude instead
# (a local, untracked ignore file — see `git help gitignore`), so this
# tracked .gitignore stays the same on every machine.